    "accessibility": {
      "short": "Painted bedroom with blue walls, wooden bed and chairs, open green window, and hanging pictures.",
      "long": "A vibrant interior painting showing a sparsely furnished bedroom. A large wooden bed with white linens and a red blanket sits on the right. Two wooden chairs with woven seats flank a small table holding a ceramic pitcher, basin, glass bottles, and books. The walls are textured blue; the floor shows diagonal planks in green, pink, and brown. An open green-shuttered window emits bright yellow-green light. Several framed pictures hang unevenly on the wall; clothes hang on a rack and a towel hangs on the left door frame. Brushwork is thick and visible throughout.",
